a/islam-iii-giray">Islam III Giray</a> allies with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bohdan-khmelnytsky">Bohdan Khmelnytsky</a> against <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/polish-lithuanian-commonwealth">Poland-Lithuania</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1736</span><span class="rf-text">A Russian army under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/burkhard-christoph-von-munnich">Münnich</a> burns <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bakhchysarai">Bakhchysarai</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1774</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-kucuk-kaynarca">Treaty of Kuchuk Kainarji</a> ends Ottoman suzerainty</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1783</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/catherine-the-great">Catherine II</a> annexes the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/crimea">Crimea</a> to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/russian-empire">Russian Empire</a></span></li></ol>
